{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b05a101c33cab7b3f163b819a756ec6573052e9952468dc3ed45588607c97aed", "ja": "（今日は美也のポスター撮影で南の島へ来た。\n撮影テーマは『南国に咲いた花の妖精』だ）", "zh": "（今天为了拍摄美也的海报，我们来到了南方的小岛。\n拍摄的主题是『绽放于南国的花之精灵』。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "a204f523284c6916a1fc5a5d685194a5752b71250f947c83f5e3a7bed5689fb0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、撮影、終わりました～。\n私、妖精さんになれていたでしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，拍摄结束了～。\n我有好好变成小妖精了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1002_p", "source_sha256": "70c522b8b6fd647d6bc21cb9658955b36b000f90e88399621e4c9d7e6c9d55af", "ja": "お疲れ様、美也。普段とは違う表情が、よく出てたと\n思うよ。妖精らしい、ふんわりした感じもよかった。", "zh": "辛苦了，美也。你展现出了与平时不同的表情，我觉得拍得很好。很有妖精般轻飘飘的感觉，也很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "71f3eeea0161334fd11d319027dba523539fa11eab6a0c0894ab014829a1c2e9", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。私、考えたんです。\n妖精さんが本当にいたら、どんな風に写るのかなって。", "zh": "谢谢您～我想过了。要是真有妖精的话，会以什么样的模样映入眼帘呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "1ee7a9f416fa4814bdca3c049fc75d4af8e60a443a35fb6ce5caa4bd75bf0bcd", "ja": "この辺りは、妖精さんのご近所さんですから。\nお散歩したり、水辺でリラックスしたり……。", "zh": "因为这里算是小精灵们的邻居嘛。\n可以散散步，在水边放松一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "83537ef9cf3eb3ce79f10d9f4867d3aac21ce98b2a83eeab39de81d1fc51e1ea", "ja": "妖精だけの世界で、ゆらゆら、のびのび～。\nそんな風に過ごしているイメージをしたんです。", "zh": "在只有妖精的世界里，晃晃悠悠、无拘无束～。\n我就是想象着像那样度过时光的感觉拍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b040ec6cd1cc11d895dfb88ec43e45029b295a4bbfe315cf414b5cddd71c71fc", "ja": "なるほど。だから自然と一体化したような、\n神秘的な写真が撮れたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。难怪能拍出仿佛与大自然融为一体的神秘照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "88d454f30e22750a4c364e89cf224541f3d43f36b5e69b88f7ffd5096e01005f", "ja": "むふふ。こんなに素敵なところですから、もしかすると\n本物の妖精さんも、いるかもしれませんな～。", "zh": "呜呼呼。这里这么美，说不定真的会有妖精呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1008_p", "source_sha256": "56e6009e9d270d192923fb7661396cef787d2943f05b5bfa35128680deeba17f", "ja": "そうだな。水の綺麗な場所だし、\n妖精がいてもおかしくないかもな。", "zh": "是啊。这里的水这么清澈，\n就算有妖精也不奇怪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "e5f7557f00988589e944852992f721953772d54da68a94ce3c5e1c6d2c82babc", "ja": "はい～。もし会えたら、なにをして遊びましょう～？\n妖精さんが、将棋や囲碁をご存知だといいんですけど。", "zh": "是呀～。要是能见到的话，该和它玩些什么呢～？\n要是花之精灵也会下将棋或围棋就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "75668eb3a808368eae6e62f7e9f5d07ccd45bc2d494c566e406897dd7959d72b", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nお花の妖精さんに会ったら、何がしたいですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生呢，\n要是遇到花之妖精，想做什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d56f6ed7ae3489e91768dcb729480dbda27085fd80717dc9f7ed3a1dd0f8d598", "ja": "そうだなあ……。\nアイドルに興味がないか、聞いてみるかも……？", "zh": "这个嘛……  \n或许会问问她有没有兴趣当偶像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "fe1868741b4bed632388574759b1118cd08f813897cac38b1bd84e661db1b4ab", "ja": "……妖精さんをスカウトするんですか？\n{$P$}さんらしいですね～。", "zh": "……您要去星探小妖精吗？\n真有{$P$}先生的风格呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5b5227da42dfae9a77219386153b048b1f48ccde6ae092f3e4ec5c933a9c75cf", "ja": "でも……目の前にも、\nお花の妖精さんがいるのを忘れていませんか～？", "zh": "不过……您是不是忘了，眼前也有一位花之精灵呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "de77dd392101e4cd0a6db79874aca1bc3b2f195569f3ecce97683c348c5eabb6", "ja": "むーん……{$P$}さんには、\n私は妖精さんに見えなかったようですね……。", "zh": "嗯……看来在{$P$}先生眼里，我没能被看成仙女呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "ce51f3be6651dea0e0af36782d949d96c1dc60494c17e30496afa08eb0292b1f", "ja": "なんだか、気持ちがどよ～んとしてきました……。\nはあ～……。", "zh": "不知怎么的，心情变得阴沉沉的……  \n唉～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1017_p", "source_sha256": "328381f6b89465db6eb78c9a87d4179d957ddfa161dcdca1b635f094ea5f4777", "ja": "い、いや、違うんだ！\n美也は美也で、妖精とはまた違った……。", "zh": "不、不是那回事！  \n美也是美也，和妖精又是另一种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "0ebe357d05cbfd2c00f8ff6e140c9540087141b74fe42ca524fea635bf42ab71", "ja": "わかってますよ、{$P$}さん。\nちょっとだけ、からかってみました～。むふふ♪", "zh": "我明白的，{$P$}先生。\n只是稍微逗了你一下～嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c8c4d95fb81e5a390323bf7c7d2d6da647889fa9d544a4cf758c05121c2c5611", "ja": "えっ！？　な、なんだ、そうか……。\nびっくりしたよ。", "zh": "诶！？原、原来是这样啊……吓我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "84eeac8b4a2a1b1a75f0177226cb6330d481ac6171046da6cc447abeee7bfbda", "ja": "うふふ、妖精さんはイタズラが好きみたいです。\nだから私も……。大成功でしたな～。", "zh": "呵呵，妖精好像很喜欢恶作剧呢。\n所以我也……大成功了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "b0aba923bd9f6b94cec29ea4573c304076ff42729978d36a0631e3e53e38a106", "ja": "上手にイタズラできたので\nこれで私も、立派な妖精さんのお友達ですね～♪", "zh": "因为恶作剧做得很成功，\n这样一来，我也算是了不起的妖精朋友了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0564_1022_p", "source_sha256": "29ce60627c4f663736dc0916e8b566f17c08b9ccfd91a0e05216c62f6cd3a7d3", "ja": "（いい写真が撮れたのも、美也の魅力に惹かれて\n妖精が力を貸してくれたの……かも？）", "zh": "（能拍到好照片，也是因为被美也的魅力吸引，妖精才出手相助的……也许？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
